nt-family: 맑은 고딕\">기납부금액에서 차액만 납부하면 됩니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -26.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">재학연한 범위내에서 가능하며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">최대 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">회까지 신청가능합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">회 신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">→</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">한 학기만 신청 가능</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">재학연한 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수업연한의 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">배</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">5. 기타 알림사항(졸업사정 후 학적관련)</span></span></span></strong></span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><o:p></o:p></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 가. 다른 졸업 불합격 사유없이 졸업논문(시험) 또는 졸업외국어시험이 불합격일 경우</font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 학적이 재학생에서 수료생으로 변경됨, 수강신청 할 수 없음</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 나</span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">. 졸업논문(시험) 또는 졸업외국어시험 외 다른 졸업 불합격 사유가 있을 경우</font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; → 학기초과자(수업연한초과자)로 구분되며 학적은 재학생임</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 다. 모든 졸업자격을 충족하였고, 졸업유예를 신청하는 경우</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&